Mind: Where am I? What is this place?

Mind: That was a long fall. I hope I didn't break anything. Regardless, I think I can lift myself up. I just need to focus.

<<wait 1.5>>

Mind: I think I can head up there using a block. Shouldn't be too hard to float up.
<<startShaking Camera>>

<<stopShaking Camera>>

Mind: Ugh! I can't float. That fall did more damage than I thought. I need to find something to help me up there.

<<pan Camera Right>>

Heart: I remember now... it was the heartbreak from the memory inside the rose. It must have what have weakened the floor to the point of breaking... is everything here a metaphor?! 

<<wait 3>>

Heart: ...

Heart: Nevermind. Right now, I have to find a way to Mind.

